an (New), Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"qeBFhxtnBkkT6HU9Meix0g","review_id":"aE8Al3U7uy8F49JGYdPtCw","date":"2018-11-15T01:17:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9237266182899475,"text_excerpt":"Cool, trendy spot with a nice ambiance. I attended a Yelp event there over the summer and my friend and I both enjoyed our cocktails (some sort of berry spritz) and munchies. Their roasted cauliflower is particularly superb. Only thing that could have been improved: we were somewhat forgotten about for a while, being seated at the end of the bar, so we did miss out on some of the foods."},{"business_id":"qeBFhxtnBkkT6HU9Meix0g","review_id":"GBXUj5lkteBqmYucwByZpw","date":"2018-08-04T23:06:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9202853441238403,"text_excerpt":"A nice, modern spot on Canal street featuring trendy cocktails and menu. My wife and I had a quick stop here for a drink and a quick bite so unfortunately I do not have much to write. But I will say their Old Fashioned was one of the best I have ever tasted. Whomever thought of adding caramel popcorn for a garnish to the drink deserves a medal :) We shared the crawfish ravioli which was spot on, nice sized portion packed with seafood and a light cream to compliment the dish. Good place to try close to the quarter but not in the madness."},{"business_id":"qeBFhxtnBkkT6HU9Meix0g","review_id":"Jrr-EQ1QCf9Oq9ACDmoN2Q","date":"2018-08-09T01:24:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8986823558807373,"text_excerpt":"Excellent! Food is wonderfully prepared. The roasted cauliflower (salad) was scrumptious. Ravioli--yum. Lots of mushrooms. Had the oysters and they were delish! Dave is the consummate overseer. He was attentive, helpful, as were the rest of the staff at this new restaurant on Canal. Very near to Saenger theater. You have to try it."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"qeBFhxtnBkkT6HU9Meix0g","photo_id":"VTwH5jsr716QsJGZiEU-pA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/VTwH5jsr716QsJGZiEU-pA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9094719886779785},{"business_id":"qeBFhxtnBkkT6HU9Meix0g","photo_id":"osPve32evqi2qg-WZ3u9Ag","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/osPve32evqi2qg-WZ3u9Ag.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.891451358795166},{"business_id":"qeBFhxtnBkkT6HU9Meix0g","photo_id":"jhoNI7vni1XN9NUd5A1-sQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jhoNI7vni1XN9NUd5A1-sQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8711178302764893},{"business_id":"qeBFhxtnBkkT6HU9Meix0g","photo_id":"BiJ0Nr2NZKA3I9rwn5OK-A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/BiJ0Nr2NZKA3I9rwn5OK-A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8201442360877991},{"business_id":"qeBFhxtnBkkT6HU9Meix0g","photo_id":"Id_OhDmj76wVP2SL-UpNdw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Id_OhDmj76wVP2SL-UpNdw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8192287683486938}]},"notebook_case":null}
